# gh-review-tool — optional environment configuration
#
# This tool does NOT require any environment variables.
# Authentication is handled entirely by the gh CLI (gh auth login)
# and opencode's own configuration.
#
# The following variables are intentionally stripped from all subprocess
# environments so that child processes use gh CLI's keyring auth:
#   GITHUB_TOKEN  (removed automatically if set)
#   GH_TOKEN      (removed automatically if set)
#
# This prevents accidental token leakage into opencode or git subprocesses.
